00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:18.660
Just indications.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.840
Take the large brush and very gently lift upward

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:37.640
just to create a little bit of mist down at the bottom.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:40.540
Just a little bit of mist.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.770
Now we know there's gonna be some water back here,

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:46.100
