00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:54.330
Not much at this time, just a little bit.

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:56.190
Not gonna worry about it right now.

00:07:56.190 --> 00:08:00.000
Now, I'm gonna go right into the, this is sap green.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:05.100
Alizarin Crimson, and Prussian Blue.

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:08.090
We just mix it right here on the brush.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:10.090
Maybe, maybe, maybe.

