just to get very light over here, just sort of disappear.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.540
Maybe there's another little tree here,

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:45.240
a little bush or tree.

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:55.340
You have to make these decisions, what you want it to be.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:58.160
Now, I'm gonna take a little bit of this color,

