it's a very brownish looking

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.760
and just wipe a little bit of it like this.

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:09.890
Just a little bit of it, pull it across.

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:15.790
With my large brush, pull it on out a little.

